# Wattleflow documentation — staged publication.
#
# Decision 2026-10-03: the repository publishes the generic layer only, one
# record at a time. Everything is ignored unless it is listed below; a record
# enters publication by adding its own `!` line. Git history up to v0.0.5 is
# kept as it is (D-03, D-05) — nothing is rewritten.
#
# Consequence declared (D-11): published records cite files that are not yet
# published (sibling FRQ, NFRQ, 06-ANALYSIS). Those links do not resolve for
# the reader of the published edition until the cited record is admitted.

# --- Ignore everything ----------------------------------------------------
/*

# --- Repository essentials -------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/wattleflow.png

# --- Requirements: generic layer, admitted one by one ---------------------
!/requirements/
/requirements/*

!/requirements/01-HLRQ/
/requirements/01-HLRQ/*
!/requirements/01-HLRQ/HLRQ-01-GENERIC-LAYER.md

!/requirements/02-FRQ/
/requirements/02-FRQ/*
!/requirements/02-FRQ/FRQ-AUD-01-audit-record-path.md
!/requirements/02-FRQ/FRQ-BBD-blackboard.md

# PlantUML style included by every inline diagram.
!/requirements/styles/
/requirements/styles/*
!/requirements/styles/wattleflow.puml

.gitignore
CLAUDE.md

.*